OL,3,GNEWSA'Generational opportunity' to
OL,4,Acreate sports hub
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners have warned that a
OL,7,F"generational opportunity" to build a
OL,8,Fsports hub will be missed, if local
OL,9,Fcouncils and developers fail to "join
OL,10,Fthe bits of the puzzle together".
OL,12,FChipping Norton resident Nick Jones is
OL,13,Fleading a campaign for those involved
OL,14,Fin plans for homes to the east of the
OL,15,Ftown, to agree a 'land swap' to "make
OL,16,Fthe dream a reality".
OL,18,F"If planning applications are signed
OL,19,Foff piecemeal, we miss the opportunity"
OL,20,Fhe said.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
