OL,3,GNEWSA'Generational opportunity' to
OL,4,Acreate sports hub
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe lead for planning at West
OL,7,FOxfordshire District Council, Liz
OL,8,FLeffman said: "we are absolutely in
OL,9,Fagreement that we need a multi-sports
OL,10,Fhub <but> we can't do anything about
OL,11,Fcreating a land swap. That has to be
OL,12,Fdone between the owners of those pieces
OL,13,Fof land".
